	measure 'Taux de recommandation' = ```
			
			DIVIDE(
			    CALCULATE(
			        COUNTROWS('Fait avis'),
			        'Fait avis'[recommande_employeur] = TRUE()
			    ),
			    COUNTROWS('Fait avis')
			)
			
			```
		formatString: 0.00\ %;-0.00\ %;0.00\ %
		lineageTag: 2df2b5e5-bf41-4b6d-a36c-e1f461aa1da4

	measure 'Taux d''approbation du PDG' =
			
			DIVIDE(
